Committed test fixtures (synthesized, no third-party data)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
overlume/tests/fixtures/environment_tiles_fixture_0/ and
environment_tiles_fixture_fallback_0/ hold 3D Tiles payloads (tileset.json +
.b3dm) generated entirely by overlume/scripts/make_tile_fixture.py — a
deterministic, fixed-seed, dependency-free generator producing synthetic
extruded-box "buildings". Nothing in either directory is fetched from Cesium
ion, OpenStreetMap, or any other service; there is no OpenStreetMap/ODbL
attribution obligation for these fixtures. See the PROVENANCE.md next to
each for exactly what each tile carries and how to regenerate it.

These replace an earlier version of these fixtures that held real,
unmodified Cesium ion asset 96188 ("Cesium OSM Buildings") tile bytes; those
blobs were purged from this repository's history by path on 2026-09-18 (git filter-repo, force-pushed; a GitHub Support request covers the unreachable and LFS objects).
